 "intro_zh": "龟峰发育于距今1.35亿年的白垩纪晚期，属典型的丹霞地貌，因景区内有无数形态酷似乌龟的象形石和整个景区远远看去像一只硕大无朋的巨龟而得名。",
 "intro_en": "Guifeng was developed in the late Cretaceous period 135 million years ago. It is a typical Danxia landform. It is named because there are countless pictographic stones that resemble turtles in the scenic area and the entire scenic area looks like a huge giant turtle from a distance.",
